# POLLY, the transposition Home shows a song's chords at: the section playing's while the song plays; stopped, section
# 1's (where PLAY starts, the section Home shows), not the last section played's. Two sections of P1, the second +2.
wait 300
tap HOME
expect page 1
tapkey w0
tapkey w0
expect rows 2
turn K1 -1
expect cursor 2
turn SELECT 1
expect page 2
turn K1 2
expect row_key2 2
tap PLAY
wait 16000
expect playing 1
expect row 2
expect xpose_now 2
tap PLAY
wait 500
expect playing 0
expect xpose_now 0
